event: thinking
data: {"id": "0bf2d2ef81404afb-thinking-parallel_evidence-856", "run_id": "0bf2d2ef81404afb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 节点标签验证结果\n\n集群 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）均**没有** `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签。\n\n这直接证实了调度失败的根因：\n- Pod 要求 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n- 集群所有节点均无此标签\n- 因此 0/3 节点满足调度约束\n\n## 证据总结\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **状态** | Pod 持续 Pending，node: `<none>` |\n| **事件** | `FailedScheduling: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` |\n| **调度约束** | Node-Selector: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` |\n| **节点标签** | master/node1/node2 均无 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签 |\n| **Metrics** | `kube_pod_status_phase", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789036301381, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

